# Build an AI-Powered Personal Finance Management Platform

You are building **{{app.name}}** — "{{app.tagline}}".

Deliver a production-grade, responsive web platform where users manage their
money with the help of AI: track spending, receive personalized budget advice,
save toward goals, pay down debt, and learn financial literacy. Every screen
must be fast, accessible (WCAG 2.1 AA), and polished on mobile and desktop.

